        <terms:description rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">Diagram (this article has no graphical representation)</terms:description>
        <terms:title rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">Smarthome Sensing Pattern</terms:title>
        <cpannotationschema:coversRequirements rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">What is the output of the sensing process?</cpannotationschema:coversRequirements>
        <cpannotationschema:coversRequirements rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">What sensors are involved (implement) the sensing process?</cpannotationschema:coversRequirements>
        <cpannotationschema:coversRequirements rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">When the sensor output is generated by the sensor?</cpannotationschema:coversRequirements>
        <cpannotationschema:coversRequirements rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">Which feature of interest is considered for the observation (sensing) process?</cpannotationschema:coversRequirements>
        <cpannotationschema:isSpecializationOf rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">The pattern extends both the SSN ontology and DUL. The extension is in the form of specialization of the following classes: http://purl.oclc.org/NET/ssnx/ssn#Output
http://www.ontologydesignpatterns.org/ont/dul/DUL.owl#InformationRealization
http://purl.oclc.org/NET/ssnx/ssn#Sensing
http://purl.oclc.org/NET/ssnx/ssn#SensingDevice</cpannotationschema:isSpecializationOf>
        <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">Curated by OntoBoard 1.155.0, so that the pattern passes ODK&apos;s quality report with its default profile, names every term with a label, and is consistent and coherent. Changes: label added x36; term declared x6;
- header: dcterms:title &quot;Smarthome Sensing Pattern&quot; - the library&apos;s name for the pattern
- header: dcterms:description - the library&apos;s description of the pattern
Each change is listed under &quot;curated&quot; in the pattern&apos;s metadata.json in OntoBoard&apos;s pattern library.</rdfs:comment>
        <rdfs:isDefinedBy rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">This pattern uses the ODP featureOfInterest (http://ontologydesignpatterns.org/wiki/Submissions:SmartHome_FeatureOfInterest).</rdfs:isDefinedBy>
